# IntelliJ HTTP Client. Sustituir variables localmente; no guardar tokens reales en Git.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@v = v1
@username = admin
@password = REEMPLAZAR_CON_PASSWORD_DE_LOCAL_ACCESO
@token = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ACCESS_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN
@estudianteId = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_REAL
@cursoId = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_REAL
@matriculaId = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_REAL

### Login: para funcional cambiar /login por /v2/login
POST {{base}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### Crear estudiante; repetir con v2 cambiando @v
POST {{base}}/{{v}}/estudiantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombres":"Ana","apellidos":"Perez","dni":"00123456","edad":24}

### Listar estudiantes
GET {{base}}/{{v}}/estudiantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar estudiante
GET {{base}}/{{v}}/estudiantes/{{estudianteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar estudiante
PUT {{base}}/{{v}}/estudiantes/{{estudianteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombres":"Ana Maria","apellidos":"Perez","dni":"00123456","edad":25}

### Edad ascendente
GET {{base}}/{{v}}/estudiantes/edad/asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Edad descendente
GET {{base}}/{{v}}/estudiantes/edad/desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear curso
POST {{base}}/{{v}}/cursos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Spring WebFlux","siglas":"SWF","estado":true}

### Listar cursos
GET {{base}}/{{v}}/cursos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar curso
GET {{base}}/{{v}}/cursos/{{cursoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar curso
PUT {{base}}/{{v}}/cursos/{{cursoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombre":"Spring WebFlux AI","siglas":"SWF","estado":false}

### Registrar matrícula con referencias reales
POST {{base}}/{{v}}/matriculas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fechaMatricula":"2026-10-30T10:30:00","estudiante":{"id":"{{estudianteId}}"},"cursos":[{"id":"{{cursoId}}"}],"estado":true}

### Consultar matrícula histórica
GET {{base}}/{{v}}/matriculas/{{matriculaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrar curso (después de comprobar la matrícula)
DELETE {{base}}/{{v}}/cursos/{{cursoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrar estudiante
DELETE {{base}}/{{v}}/estudiantes/{{estudianteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Acceso sin JWT: debe devolver 401
GET {{base}}/{{v}}/cursos
